# Engine builds. Multi-gigabyte prebuilt artifacts, unpacked or pointed at
# locally: SpiderMonkey's spidermonkey.lib alone is 629 MB and V8's monolith is
# larger. Nothing under dependencies/ is ever committed except the prose that
# says where to get them, and the rule is written as "ignore the directory" so
# that a third engine is covered the day it appears.
/dependencies/*
!/dependencies/README.md

# Build output
/build/
/out/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exe
*.tlog

# Downloaded archives (an engine release, usually)
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz

# vcpkg
/vcpkg_installed/

# Editors and IDEs
/.vs/
/.idea/
*.vcxproj.user
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# CMake user presets: where the paths that name one machine belong
CMakeUserPresets.json
